{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>經常忘記上次澆花或服藥的時間嗎？Keep Track 讓你以最簡單的方式記錄生活大小事，適合想建立或戒掉習慣、需要照顧家人與寵物，或只想把繁雜家務理順的人。應用程式原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>單鍵記錄任何生活項目</h2>\n<p>Keep Track 不設預設清單，也不必設定固定目標，你只需輸入想留意的項目，例如服藥、寵物照顧、運動或家務，之後輕點一下即可記錄。時間軸會顯示每次記錄的實際時間，讓你一眼看出次數，以及距離上次已過多久。應用程式完全離線運作，不需帳號亦不追蹤資料，並支援 Face ID 鎖上。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-355-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-356-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-357-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-358-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-359-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-360-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Keep Track: Life Log</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-23T18:39:34.912198+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":309,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}